    "methods_description": "Continuous EEG was recorded from 31 active Ag/AgCl electrodes (10/20 system) using an actiChamp Plus amplifier at 1000 Hz, referenced to FCz with ground at FPz. Stimuli were random-dot kinematograms (1200 white dots, 2.53 deg/s) presented on a 240 Hz LCD monitor at 65 cm viewing distance. Motion coherence was individualized using two QUEST staircases targeting 75% discrimination accuracy. The experiment included learning blocks and test blocks across three conditions with auditory cues and jittered intertrial intervals.",
